{"video":"iuc2F3YNDKs","lines":[{"t":[0,1],"en":"Whoo!"},{"t":[10.5,12],"en":"Okay."},{"t":[12,13.2],"en":"Double shift, remember?"},{"t":[13.2,15.3],"en":"So I won't see you till tomorrow."},{"t":[15.3,16.2],"en":"Are you gonna be okay?"},{"t":[16.2,19.8],"en":"Oh, yeah. I got, uh, dinner."},{"t":[19.8,21.3],"en":"Oh, God."},{"t":[21.3,25.3],"en":"Honey, can you just clean up a little bit?"},{"t":[25.3,26.6],"en":"I'll try."},{"t":[26.6,27.8],"en":"Don't expect much."},{"t":[27.8,30.4],"en":"Okay, I'll do it when I get home."},{"t":[30.4,31.4],"en":"You will?"},{"t":[31.4,32.1],"en":"Yes."},{"t":[32.1,33.6],"en":"Anne is amazing."},{"t":[33.6,35],"en":"She takes care of me."},{"t":[35,37.6],"en":"She takes care of sick people, sick babies."},{"t":[37.6,42.6],"en":"She is an angel, and I seriously love her."},{"t":[42.6,44.4],"en":"Hard."},{"t":[44.4,46.6],"en":"She's going to be gone for the next 24 hours,"},{"t":[46.6,49.2],"en":"so I made this list, and basically,"},{"t":[49.2,51.4],"en":"this place is gonna be like a sparkling palace"},{"t":[51.4,53.7],"en":"when she returns."},{"t":[53.7,54.8],"en":"I took a bunch of painkillers."},{"t":[54.8,57.4],"en":"They're about to kick in, so I'm ready to go."},{"t":[57.8,62.6],"en":"I wish I could say some of this mess was ends,"},{"t":[62.6,65.2],"en":"but it's all mine."},{"t":[65.2,66.7],"en":"I'm kind of a nester."},{"t":[68.7,71.4],"en":"Huh? Not bad for a guy with two broken legs?"},{"t":[79.5,80.5],"en":"Hey."},{"t":[82.2,83],"en":"Hey."},{"t":[83,86.8],"en":"There's only one more thing I need to clean."},{"t":[86.8,87.8],"en":"Me."},{"t":[87.8,90.4],"en":"Um, I can't really get into a shower,"},{"t":[90.4,93.8],"en":"so I got this idea for my parents."},{"t":[93.8,95.9],"en":"This is how they clean their dog."},{"t":[95.9,98.8],"en":"Mmm, mmm, mmm."},{"t":[98.8,100.9],"en":"Ha, ha, ha."},{"t":[100.9,101.8],"en":"You like that?"},{"t":[101.8,102.8],"en":"Huh?"},{"t":[102.8,105.8],"en":"I wrote that for Anne."},{"t":[105.8,107.7],"en":"It's gonna be playing when she walks through the door today."},{"t":[107.7,110.2],"en":"Oh, and check this out."},{"t":[110.2,111.6],"en":"Washed my shorts."},{"t":[111.6,112.6],"en":"How do you like that?"},{"t":[115.4,116.8],"en":"Hey, turn that down."},{"t":[116.8,118.3],"en":"No, I wrote that song."},{"t":[118.3,119.3],"en":"I don't care. Turn it down."},{"t":[119.3,120.9],"en":"What are you doing in my yard, Lawrence?"},{"t":[120.9,121.9],"en":"Get out of here."},{"t":[121.9,122.9],"en":"Okay, you know what?"},{"t":[122.9,123.5],"en":"I'm taking it."},{"t":[123.5,124.9],"en":"Put down my boombox."},{"t":[124.9,126],"en":"It's my boombox now."},{"t":[126,126.8],"en":"I asked you nicely."},{"t":[126.8,128.8],"en":"You did not ask me nicely."},{"t":[128.8,130.5],"en":"Put that down."},{"t":[130.5,133.5],"en":"I just put 12 new batteries in that thing!"},{"t":[139.3,140.4],"en":"Lawrence, come on!"},{"t":[140.4,141.5],"en":"Come on out of here."},{"t":[141.5,142.7],"en":"Give it to me!"},{"t":[144.7,145.2],"en":"Come on, come on."},{"t":[145.2,146.2],"en":"Come back inside, Hank."},{"t":[152.4,154],"en":"What do you think?"},{"t":[154,156.8],"en":"Andy, this is so sweet."},{"t":[156.8,157.7],"en":"Nothing."},{"t":[157.7,158.9],"en":"What happened to you?"},{"t":[158.9,162.9],"en":"Oh, I was chasing our neighbor, who was a total jagweed."},{"t":[162.9,165.4],"en":"I fell in some prickly bushes."},{"t":[165.4,166],"en":"Doesn't matter."},{"t":[166,167.2],"en":"What do you think of the house?"},{"t":[167.2,168.6],"en":"Huh?"},{"t":[168.6,169.8],"en":"Were you totally surprised?"},{"t":[169.8,170.3],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[170.3,170.8],"en":"Do you love it?"},{"t":[170.8,172.4],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[172.4,173.1],"en":"Here, baby, sit down."},{"t":[173.1,174.5],"en":"I'm gonna put something on those scratches."},{"t":[177,180.1],"en":"Somebody is getting gently laid tonight."},{"t":[180.1,181.4],"en":"Andy!"},{"t":[181.4,182.4],"en":"God!"},{"t":[188.9,